      "expectation": "Needs review when a field seems to collect information about the user (type\nemail or tel; a label, id or name naming e-mail, phone, address, postal\ncode, birth date, password, or the person's name) and has no autocomplete\ntoken (missing, empty, on or off). Whether the field really concerns the\nuser is a guess, so never a confirmed violation. The name of a thing\n(\"Project name\", \"Name\" of a saved view, \"Dateiname\"), technical addresses\n(\"IP address\"), \"tel\" inside \"Hotel\" and search boxes are not reported. A\nfield with a valid token is not reported.",
